OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fstart to the night, with prolonged
OL,7,Fclear spells developing by dawn,
OL,8,Fallowing some frost to form in rural
OL,9,Fspots. A generally cold feel to the
OL,10,Fnight, with a brisk wind along the
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA mix of clear spells and
OL,14,Fcloudy periods throughout the day but
OL,15,Fstaying dry. Feeling cool, with a
OL,16,Fbrisk easterly wind, particularly
OL,17,Falong the coast where it will be
OL,18,Fstronger.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
