OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and cloudy periods on Thursday.
OL,7,FA slow-moving band of rain gradually
OL,8,Fmoves eastwards on Friday. Outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain, heavy at times, on Saturday.
OL,10,FTemperatures generally remaining below
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
